WEBVTT

00:05.080 --> 00:06.630
Um...

00:06.630 --> 00:08.380
Ein...

00:09.760 --> 00:11.630
I'd like to ask you a favor.

00:12.970 --> 00:15.890
Can you please kiss me?

00:17.640 --> 00:19.390
Yuri...

00:19.390 --> 00:22.390
Curb your jokes, will you?

00:22.390 --> 00:23.890
I'm not joking!

00:24.200 --> 00:28.440
It's a ritual of contract performed
between a spirit and its guardian!

00:28.440 --> 00:32.280
As regrettable as it is,
it is necessary.

00:32.280 --> 00:36.030
Up until now, you were merely
an apprentice guardian.

00:36.030 --> 00:40.370
The connection between you
and Yuri has been unstable.

00:40.370 --> 00:46.420
That's why your mana fluctuated at times,
either too strong or too weak,

00:46.420 --> 00:49.340
and that imbalance
has put a strain on Yuri.

00:49.340 --> 00:52.170
I didn't realize that was the case...

00:53.820 --> 00:56.800
Sorry for burdening you all this time.

00:56.800 --> 00:59.560
I'm fine. It's nothing.

00:59.560 --> 01:04.272
Now that you've awakened
and fully connected to Yuri as a guardian,

01:04.272 --> 01:08.810
the ritual is necessary to
strengthen the connection.

01:08.810 --> 01:12.480
W-Well, I suppose a contract by kiss is,

01:12.480 --> 01:15.820
more or less, like a knight's vow
of loyalty, right?

01:16.160 --> 01:18.490
If that's how it is,
then shall we...

01:18.490 --> 01:19.200
Wait.

01:19.200 --> 01:21.790
Do you two need to be so close...

01:21.790 --> 01:26.080
Don't mind us! Just go for a big smooch!

01:26.080 --> 01:28.710
Yes, take your time.

01:28.710 --> 01:31.960
Hang on, I can't do that with
you gawking at me...

01:31.960 --> 01:35.470
Pina, Lady Kurohime, you're troubling him.

01:35.470 --> 01:37.090
Please give him some space.

01:37.090 --> 01:41.220
Oh my, if Ursula insists,
I suppose we have no choice.

01:41.220 --> 01:45.640
Aren't you being too calm for having
a stranger kiss your beloved daughter?

01:45.640 --> 01:46.730
How so?

01:46.730 --> 01:49.480
He's no stranger to us, so he's fine.

01:49.610 --> 01:51.690
Only kissing, though.

01:51.690 --> 01:53.480
Do anything more and you're dead.

01:57.700 --> 02:00.620
Well, then.
Shall we, Yuri?

02:01.160 --> 02:03.700
Sure. By the way, Ein.

02:03.700 --> 02:06.620
This is my first time,
so please, be gentle.

02:09.880 --> 02:13.750
Wait, what?! Wasn't I supposed to
kiss on the back of the hand?

02:15.970 --> 02:18.010
Mouth to mouth?!

02:18.010 --> 02:21.140
N-No, this is for the ritual!

02:21.140 --> 02:22.930
It's necessary!

02:23.680 --> 02:25.600
I'll do it. I'm doing it!

02:33.480 --> 02:35.820
(Divine Eye (SS) — Enhances abilities and imbues
divine power with the prosthetic spirit's eye.)

02:35.820 --> 02:38.820
Did... did it just level me up?!

02:38.820 --> 02:41.570
Uh, Yuri...

02:41.570 --> 02:45.120
I'm so happy
I'm ascending to heaven!

02:45.120 --> 02:47.080
Get a hold of yourself, Yuri!

02:47.080 --> 02:50.040
Yuri!!

02:51.170 --> 02:56.130
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

02:56.130 --> 03:00.970
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

03:00.970 --> 03:10.730
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

03:10.730 --> 03:15.480
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

03:15.480 --> 03:19.860
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

03:20.740 --> 03:24.660
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

03:24.660 --> 03:27.870
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

03:29.290 --> 03:34.040
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

03:34.040 --> 03:38.710
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

03:38.710 --> 03:40.970
♪See the world through my eyes♪

03:40.970 --> 03:43.300
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

03:43.300 --> 03:48.810
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

03:50.020 --> 03:54.400
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

03:54.860 --> 03:59.530
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

03:59.530 --> 04:04.410
♪Because you have given it to me♪

04:04.410 --> 04:11.200
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

04:26.010 --> 04:28.010
Look who we have here.

04:28.890 --> 04:30.810
Pleased to see you, Lady Echidna.

04:30.810 --> 04:34.020
Welcome to my estate.

04:34.020 --> 04:36.900
Likewise, Baron Falco.

04:36.900 --> 04:39.900
So, what brings you here today?

04:39.900 --> 04:43.570
I've brought the Demon King's
royal decree.

04:44.910 --> 04:48.910
You are ordered to kill
this young man.

04:49.910 --> 04:52.200
A Demon King's order or not,

04:52.200 --> 04:56.040
there's no reason for me to personally
take care of a mere monkey.

04:56.580 --> 04:59.710
Oh, make no mistake about him.

04:59.710 --> 05:04.090
He has single-handedly taken care of
Behemoth, the ancient dragon.

05:04.090 --> 05:08.010
Heh. Ancient dragons are nothing
but slightly stronger...

05:08.010 --> 05:10.220
...than average monsters.

05:10.220 --> 05:13.850
They are merely small fries
compared to us demons.

05:13.850 --> 05:18.400
Such confidence. I like strong men.

05:18.400 --> 05:23.860
This is why both the Demon King and I
can only trust you to handle this.

05:25.860 --> 05:30.620
You are the only one that
can undergo this important mission.

05:30.620 --> 05:34.160
Then I, Falco, shall take care of this!

05:34.160 --> 05:36.620
I shall take him down splendidly!

05:37.870 --> 05:42.780
By the Demon King's command, open
the path to the human world before me!

05:43.250 --> 05:44.530
Gate!

05:48.390 --> 05:50.430
My ability is Gale!

05:50.430 --> 05:53.140
I can move in a straight line
faster than eyes can see!

05:53.770 --> 05:57.140
My speed is unmatched
among the demon nobility!

06:00.060 --> 06:02.150
That monkey is the
so-called Dragon Slayer?

06:04.320 --> 06:08.660
I am a fifth-rank noble of the demon
aristocracy, Baron Falco of the Gale!

06:08.660 --> 06:10.450
I shall take your life...

06:10.450 --> 06:11.910
Hold it.

06:11.910 --> 06:14.790
Everyone's sleeping,
so please pipe it down.

06:14.790 --> 06:18.830
How dare you to belittle me, you monkey?!

06:19.290 --> 06:20.290
Gale!

06:20.290 --> 06:23.920
I won't grant you a swift death!
My talons shall carve your flesh slowly...

06:26.350 --> 06:28.510
I can't believe that I, Baron Falco,

06:28.510 --> 06:31.010
was struck down by a single blow...

06:31.610 --> 06:33.010
Baron, you said?

06:33.010 --> 06:36.020
Isn't that the bottommost
rank of nobility?

06:36.330 --> 06:37.520
Spiral Bullets.

06:39.870 --> 06:41.770
Overwhelming!

06:42.610 --> 06:44.340
Such abnormal power...

06:44.860 --> 06:47.280
Is that eye the reason?

06:50.780 --> 06:53.490
Let's appraise this Gale ability...

06:54.280 --> 06:57.330
Still, what was his deal anyway?

06:57.330 --> 07:02.290
If he was here to end me, then he
wasn't targeting Yuri and the others...

07:02.790 --> 07:05.250
Ein, are you alright?

07:05.250 --> 07:07.420
What? What's going on?

07:07.420 --> 07:09.460
Did I wake you girls? Sorry.

07:11.010 --> 07:12.050
Well, well.

07:12.050 --> 07:16.810
I see that you've gotten stronger since
you've become a full-fledged guardian.

07:16.810 --> 07:20.190
I mean, you fought well
even without Mama Ursula's support.

07:20.190 --> 07:22.810
Maybe you've become stronger than her.

07:25.070 --> 07:27.480
Nope. I'm still far stronger.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.070
Mother! Calm down!

07:35.580 --> 07:38.240
My hero!

07:38.240 --> 07:39.200
Claudia!

07:39.200 --> 07:43.210
It's rare to see you at the castle!

07:43.210 --> 07:45.840
I've something to look up
in the Forbidden Library.

07:46.590 --> 07:49.590
The Forbidden Library
is a vast library that hosts...

07:49.590 --> 07:51.720
...books only accessible
to the royal family.

07:52.630 --> 07:54.720
This silver pocket watch
from the King...

07:54.720 --> 07:58.220
...allows me to enter
places that were off-limits.

07:59.310 --> 08:01.520
So this is the entrance, huh?

08:03.190 --> 08:05.230
Pardon me, my hero.

08:05.230 --> 08:06.730
By the ancient contract,

08:06.730 --> 08:10.610
only those permitted by the King
and the Archivist may enter.

08:10.610 --> 08:12.990
This is as far as I can guide you.

08:12.990 --> 08:16.320
It's no problem.
Thank you, Claudia.

08:16.320 --> 08:18.490
I have the King's permission, but...

08:18.490 --> 08:20.870
How do I get the Archivist's approval?

08:20.870 --> 08:23.960
You'll know once you
step through the door.

08:23.960 --> 08:27.380
You won't be able to enter
unless the Archivist permits you.

08:27.380 --> 08:29.380
Got it. I'll give it a try.

08:32.880 --> 08:34.582
Excuse me...

08:34.582 --> 08:38.010
Oh! I got in! That means I was
approved, right?

08:38.010 --> 08:39.179
Come here, Yuri.

08:39.418 --> 08:40.640
Yes!

08:42.730 --> 08:44.582
Yuri, what's wrong?

08:45.480 --> 08:49.730
I'm not sure. There's like
an invisible wall repelled me.

08:50.530 --> 08:53.090
The link between you two
suddenly cut off.

08:53.100 --> 08:54.740
What happened?

08:54.740 --> 08:57.370
Ursula, can't you teleport to me?

08:57.370 --> 09:00.370
I've been attempting to, but...

09:00.370 --> 09:04.620
Looks like there's a powerful barrier
to keep non-humans away.

09:04.620 --> 09:07.750
A barrier that even
Ursula can't pass through...

09:07.750 --> 09:09.630
I better stay on guard.

09:09.630 --> 09:12.050
I'll just go on ahead alone.

09:12.050 --> 09:14.630
That will be tough. I'm sorry.

09:14.630 --> 09:18.600
I'm just doing what I need to do,
so don't worry about it.

09:18.600 --> 09:19.510
I'll be back.

09:23.810 --> 09:26.770
Whoa, are these all books?

09:26.770 --> 09:30.320
It's going to be impossible to
find any lead among these.

09:32.320 --> 09:35.490
Huh? Is something falling down?

09:35.490 --> 09:37.320
A girl?

09:43.290 --> 09:45.080
That was close...

09:45.080 --> 09:46.410
Are you okay?

09:54.760 --> 09:56.170
Thank you.

09:56.170 --> 09:58.130
Her ears are bright red!

09:58.130 --> 10:00.680
Is she flustered? That's so cute!

10:02.680 --> 10:05.680
Uh, my name is Ein.
What about yours?

10:07.350 --> 10:08.560
Alice.

10:08.560 --> 10:12.070
Alice, I see. You were falling down
really fast it surprised me.

10:12.070 --> 10:13.190
What happened?

10:13.900 --> 10:16.820
I was reading a book,
and before I knew it, I fell.

10:16.820 --> 10:20.070
Damn... Just how absorbed
was she in the book?

10:23.540 --> 10:24.580
Wow!

10:24.580 --> 10:26.700
I just put the book back
where it belongs.

10:27.500 --> 10:30.000
After all, I'm the archivist here.

10:30.000 --> 10:32.090
So I know where every book is.

10:32.090 --> 10:34.210
Every book? That's amazing!

10:34.210 --> 10:36.380
Wait, so you're the archivist?

10:37.510 --> 10:38.380
Yes.

10:38.380 --> 10:40.340
Thank you, Alice.

10:40.340 --> 10:42.930
What are you thanking me for?

10:42.930 --> 10:46.350
Well, I wouldn't be here
unless you let me, right?

10:46.350 --> 10:47.980
I mean, you're the archivist.

10:48.690 --> 10:51.310
What are you coming here for?

10:51.860 --> 10:54.360
I'm here to research the Hidden Dungeon.

10:55.480 --> 10:57.360
And what comes after that?

10:57.360 --> 11:00.320
Well, about that, I...

11:02.120 --> 11:05.990
I want to reunite someone
dear to me with their family.

11:07.750 --> 11:08.500
I see.

11:16.300 --> 11:18.880
It has information about
the Hidden Dungeon.

11:19.470 --> 11:20.760
How about you read it?

11:20.760 --> 11:23.760
Can I, really?
Thank you, Alice!

11:25.140 --> 11:26.260
It's nothing.

11:26.260 --> 11:28.310
I'll get into this, then.

11:28.310 --> 11:29.930
Is Yuri doing well?

11:29.930 --> 11:32.770
How do you know her name was Yuri?

11:32.770 --> 11:36.320
Your left eye has her
Spirit Core in it, right?

11:36.820 --> 11:38.780
I can tell. After all...

11:40.320 --> 11:42.570
I'm a Yggdrasil's Spirit too.

11:44.950 --> 11:47.790
This place was in
the book Alice gave me, but...

11:47.790 --> 11:50.540
It's not a Hidden Dungeon either, huh...

11:50.540 --> 11:55.250
I can't imagine her giving
you the wrong book...

11:55.250 --> 11:58.300
True, that. She's a bookworm, after all.

11:58.300 --> 12:02.180
Then I'll just head back to the
library later and ask her in person.

12:03.430 --> 12:05.760
I'm sorry that I can't reunite
you all right away.

12:05.760 --> 12:08.060
But I will make it happen.

12:08.060 --> 12:09.770
So please wait a little longer.

12:09.770 --> 12:10.930
Yep.

12:10.930 --> 12:14.310
No problem, Ein.
I believe in you.

12:15.020 --> 12:18.480
You spying on that kid with
the Thousand-Mile Eye again?

12:19.570 --> 12:20.320
Mother...

12:20.320 --> 12:24.450
Why you ain't hand him the book
about this dungeon?

12:24.450 --> 12:26.320
Ain'tcha wanna see
Yuri and the others?

12:26.320 --> 12:29.290
I'm scared of being linked
to the outside world...

12:29.290 --> 12:32.290
I don't have the power to fight.

12:32.290 --> 12:34.500
I can only spy with
the Thousand-Mile Eye.

12:35.580 --> 12:38.710
Besides, there are
a lot of humans outside.

12:38.710 --> 12:43.840
I hate them. They killed Big Sis Echidna.

12:43.840 --> 12:47.350
Einsy ain't nothin' like them, right?

12:47.350 --> 12:51.060
Or you still ain't got
all your trust in him?

12:51.890 --> 12:54.480
You're a Yggdrasil's spirit?

12:54.480 --> 12:55.690
Is that really...

12:57.230 --> 13:00.730
Ya could've told me
we got a guest coming over!

13:00.730 --> 13:03.990
Not even offering a cup of tea.
This girl, I swear...

13:03.990 --> 13:07.120
Alice's guardian, I assume?

13:07.120 --> 13:08.240
Correct.

13:08.240 --> 13:12.180
I'm Suzaku's daughter, Akahane.
I'm Alice's guardian.

13:12.180 --> 13:13.250
Nice meeting ya!

13:14.250 --> 13:16.290
I'm Ein. Nice to meet you too.

13:16.290 --> 13:20.500
Einsy! Thanks for getting along
with my girl!

13:20.500 --> 13:23.760
I ain't seen her face
this happy in ages, I tell ya!

13:23.760 --> 13:24.260
Huh?

13:24.260 --> 13:26.760
That's a happy face?
In what way?

13:27.260 --> 13:30.970
Still, I can't believe Alice is a spirit.

13:30.970 --> 13:33.270
Speaking of, Yuri and Pina
are waiting out...

13:33.270 --> 13:35.020
That ain't happening.

13:35.020 --> 13:36.640
No? Why?

13:36.640 --> 13:39.890
Einsy, this ain't inside the royal castle.

13:39.890 --> 13:43.780
This here's a totally
separate Hidden Dungeon.

13:43.780 --> 13:46.960
It's set up so it connects to
the royal castle by a Gate,

13:46.960 --> 13:49.160
allowing us to teleport.

13:49.160 --> 13:53.330
Our Gate's special, you know.
First off, only humans can pass through

13:53.330 --> 13:55.830
and there's this powerful restriction—

13:55.830 --> 13:59.170
only those recognized by the king
and Alice can go through.

13:59.170 --> 14:01.670
This place holds the history, secrets,

14:01.670 --> 14:04.420
and everything about this nation.

14:04.420 --> 14:08.130
In exchange for the Yggdrasil
providin' magic to protect it,

14:08.130 --> 14:11.010
we get to read the books.

14:11.010 --> 14:14.430
But if Alice or Yuri were
to pass through the Gate,

14:14.430 --> 14:17.690
it'd break the ancient contract
that's been in place.

14:17.690 --> 14:21.190
The only way we can meet them
without breakin' that contract...

14:21.190 --> 14:23.820
...is find the Hidden Dungeon
with this library,

14:23.820 --> 14:26.490
and come here in person.

14:26.490 --> 14:31.320
What if I take Alice out
of this dungeon, instead?

14:32.330 --> 14:34.410
That'd be tough...

14:34.410 --> 14:36.330
My girl's a weakling.

14:36.330 --> 14:38.210
She wouldn't last long.

14:39.120 --> 14:43.460
Besides, it won't mean much if
she herself doesn't want to leave.

14:47.720 --> 14:51.340
Say, Alice. Don't you want to
see Yuri and Pina?

14:53.350 --> 14:56.640
Sorry, of course you do.

14:56.640 --> 14:58.730
But you're scared, right?

15:00.230 --> 15:04.150
Taking a step into a new world
is terrifying, isn't it?

15:04.900 --> 15:05.980
I get you.

15:07.070 --> 15:08.440
Because I was just the same.

15:09.650 --> 15:12.950
But I have Yuri, Ursula,
and everyone else with me,

15:12.950 --> 15:15.450
that's why I have the courage to
move forward.

15:16.620 --> 15:20.000
If you ever want to take
that first step as well,

15:20.000 --> 15:21.920
I'll give my all to support you.

15:21.920 --> 15:23.790
I'll take care of all the monsters.

15:24.500 --> 15:26.170
We can take our time.

15:26.170 --> 15:29.170
I'll get you safely to Yuri
and the others.

15:29.720 --> 15:30.760
So, Alice.

15:30.760 --> 15:33.970
Will you believe me
and let me take you?

15:36.640 --> 15:40.640
Though, I suppose you can't
just trust me that quickly.

15:41.140 --> 15:42.650
But don't you worry.

15:42.650 --> 15:46.400
I'll make sure to find this place.

15:46.400 --> 15:50.340
Well, then. I'll study about this
Hidden Dungeon from this book.

15:50.340 --> 15:51.400
Thank you.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.360
See you tomorrow.

15:54.160 --> 15:57.200
See you... tomorrow.

15:59.750 --> 16:01.410
Hey, Alice...

16:01.410 --> 16:05.170
If you don't wanna, no need
to leave here, ya know?

16:05.170 --> 16:08.090
Waitin' for that kid to find it
could be a way to go too.

16:09.420 --> 16:12.160
But you like him, don't you?

16:12.680 --> 16:15.930
You really wear your feelings
on your face, huh?

16:18.760 --> 16:21.730
I've read about it so many times in books.

16:21.730 --> 16:23.940
When you look at him, your heart pounds...

16:23.940 --> 16:26.860
I get a lump in my chest
from all this happiness.

16:26.860 --> 16:30.940
A world that was monochrome
becomes vivid and full of color.

16:31.820 --> 16:33.320
What I'm feeling must be...

16:33.950 --> 16:36.200
Reading books is all well and good,

16:36.200 --> 16:38.870
but there's stuff you can't get
just by reading.

16:39.540 --> 16:42.960
What you're feeling right now,
I think it must be that.

16:43.710 --> 16:47.710
Maybe it's time to trust him,
don't you think?

16:47.710 --> 16:51.710
You'll be fine, if anything happens,
you can always come home.

16:52.420 --> 16:56.010
No matter what,
I'll always be on your side.

16:56.010 --> 16:57.220
After all...

16:57.620 --> 17:00.210
I'm your mom, ain't I?

17:03.750 --> 17:06.164
Alice, Akahane!
Are you there?

17:07.440 --> 17:09.164
There's something I'd like to ask.

17:12.164 --> 17:16.164
All right, time to gather up
your courage and take that first step!

17:17.358 --> 17:19.642
Go on, Alice!

17:23.164 --> 17:25.836
Ein...

17:25.836 --> 17:28.250
I believe in you.

17:28.920 --> 17:31.420
Please take me
to the outside world!

17:35.970 --> 17:37.390
Please excuse me.

17:41.680 --> 17:44.390
Thank you for believing in me.

17:44.390 --> 17:46.640
Let's go to the outside world!

17:49.860 --> 17:51.690
This is Alice's Spirit Core.

17:51.690 --> 17:54.940
She can't leave this place without it.

17:55.320 --> 17:57.200
Thank you, Akahane.

17:57.200 --> 18:00.740
Also, since I can't use
teleportation magic myself,

18:03.040 --> 18:05.120
I'll entrust my clone to you.

18:05.120 --> 18:06.710
Take it with you.

18:06.710 --> 18:08.830
A clone? Amazing!

18:09.920 --> 18:12.340
Alright, once again...

18:13.050 --> 18:14.840
Let's meet your family!

18:19.050 --> 18:21.510
We did aim for the outside, but...

18:22.300 --> 18:25.730
Alice's lack of stamina was
beyond what I imagined.

18:27.700 --> 18:30.100
I can't expect Ursula's support.

18:30.100 --> 18:31.480
(Binding Net (S) — Restricts the opponent's
movements with an imperceptible net.)

18:31.490 --> 18:33.490
(Lightning Fast (S) — Unleashes a flying kick
faster than the speed of sound.)

18:36.380 --> 18:37.960
I'll have to manage!

18:39.490 --> 18:41.250
Really? A tea party?

18:52.250 --> 18:55.620
If it's just a pure sword fight,
I'd get overpowered. In that case...

19:05.560 --> 19:07.220
Lightning Flash!

19:12.520 --> 19:15.820
That's Expansive Slash
and Drawing Strike appraised.

19:16.530 --> 19:21.160
I knew you were strong,
but not this strong.

19:23.450 --> 19:25.080
What's wrong, Alice?

19:27.290 --> 19:31.290
She's just worried that
you're hurt anywhere.

19:31.290 --> 19:34.790
I'm fine. Thanks for worrying about me.

19:37.300 --> 19:40.630
Well, ain't you a natural charmer.

19:41.970 --> 19:45.890
Alright, we're almost
at the surface now.

19:45.890 --> 19:48.180
Let's go, Alice, Akahane.

19:49.020 --> 19:49.810
I see...

19:50.560 --> 19:53.060
Huh? You don't sound happy?

19:53.060 --> 19:58.440
Bet she's feelin' sad knowin' that she won't
get you to carry her anymore once we leave.

19:58.440 --> 20:01.450
You can just ask me to carry you anytime.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.450
You sure?

20:04.450 --> 20:06.490
Well, yeah...

20:07.950 --> 20:09.450
I see...

20:09.950 --> 20:12.500
My girl's doing a rom-com!

20:12.500 --> 20:15.920
The one who always had a stone-cold face.

20:15.920 --> 20:18.960
I'm so happy, I could burst!

20:21.170 --> 20:23.340
Akahane!

20:25.850 --> 20:28.850
Nice to see you again, Yuri, Pina.

20:28.850 --> 20:31.350
It's been so long, Big Sis!

20:31.350 --> 20:33.990
How are you, Big Sis Alice?

20:33.990 --> 20:35.990
Yuri, too hot. Move over.

20:35.990 --> 20:40.230
No way! Let me spoil you more!

20:40.230 --> 20:42.730
Kuro, how've you been?

20:42.730 --> 20:45.740
I'm doing well.
Glad to see you doing well too.

20:47.240 --> 20:49.450
And how about you, Ursula?

20:49.460 --> 20:51.500
Ah, all good. Thank you for asking.

20:51.500 --> 20:53.250
Well, don't be so stiff.

20:53.250 --> 20:55.250
There it is! The Guardians' hierarchy!

20:56.250 --> 20:58.630
Seeing everyone so happy
makes me happy too.

20:58.630 --> 21:02.010
Thank you for bringing me
to my sister, Ein!

21:04.760 --> 21:09.390
Well, would you look at that.
Could you be...

21:10.260 --> 21:13.270
I love you so much.

21:15.520 --> 21:17.770
Pina, what's up all of a sudden?

21:17.770 --> 21:22.030
It's not all of a sudden, though.
I really do love you.

21:23.530 --> 21:27.490
Right now, his right arm is
still vacant, by the way.

21:29.120 --> 21:31.040
I'll have...

21:32.820 --> 21:34.040
Alice?

21:34.040 --> 21:39.420
Well, well, Alice. What's up with you
hugging him all of a sudden?

21:39.420 --> 21:46.300
Could it be that you're worried that Yuri
or I am gonna steal him away from you?

21:47.300 --> 21:49.050
Pina, don't tease her too much...

21:49.050 --> 21:52.810
Did you see that?!
He just defended Big Sis Alice!

21:52.810 --> 21:56.230
Do you like her?

21:59.020 --> 22:00.550
Do you?!

22:01.070 --> 22:03.940
W-what is this situation?

22:09.570 --> 22:14.910
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:14.910 --> 22:19.920
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:19.920 --> 22:22.340
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.340 --> 22:25.420
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.430 --> 22:30.390
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.390 --> 22:37.140
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.140 --> 22:42.020
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.020 --> 22:47.030
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.030 --> 22:51.820
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.120 --> 22:55.580
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.580 --> 22:57.040
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.040 --> 23:03.920
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.800 --> 23:11.220
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.220 --> 23:15.890
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.890 --> 23:18.560
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.560 --> 23:21.150
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.150 --> 23:26.070
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.070 --> 23:28.490
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.490 --> 23:31.030
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.030 --> 23:31.660
(Even Given)

23:31.660 --> 23:32.240
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.240 --> 23:32.450
(I'm)

23:32.450 --> 23:32.620
(Actually)

23:32.620 --> 23:32.740
(the Strongest)

23:35.780 --> 23:38.450
Next episode: Nigun's Shadow.

23:38.450 --> 23:40.450
(Next episode: Nigun's Shadow)
